# Dragonhawk, Fate's Tempest: "Whenever Dragonhawk enters or attacks, exile the top X cards of your library, where X is the
# number of creatures you control with power 4 or greater." Bot1 casts it on turn 1 ({3}{R}{R}: Black Lotus, Mox Ruby and
# Mox Pearl); it is the only such creature, so X = 1 and the Mountain on top is exiled. "You may play those cards until your
# next end step": Bot1 plays the Mountain from exile as its land drop, so at the beginning of the end step none of the
# cards is still exiled and Dragonhawk deals no damage (Bot2 stays at 20).

